        "description": "Identification of pathogenic variants in the LAMA2 gene",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      },
      {
        "id": "brain-mri",
        "description": "Brain MRI showing white matter abnormalities consistent with merosin deficiency",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of early onset hypotonia and muscle weakness plus either muscle biopsy showing merosin deficiency or pathogenic LAMA2 variants",
    "notes": "Genetic confirmation is preferred for definitive diagnosis."
